  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Reverse Trade Mission - Waste-to-Energy Reverse Trade Mission, through Gas Technology Institute</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This contract funds a reverse trade mission (RTM) to introduce Indonesian delegates from the government, parastatal, and private sectors to U.S. technology, regulations and best practices for biomass and municipal solid waste processing and power generation. The delegates will travel to three cities in the United States in order to meet with U.S. companies and conduct site visits to see American technology manufactured and in use.</narrative>
  </description>
